-- test: a constant named in many `expect` lines counts once in each toward the cap of 10,000,000 elements, fields and characters that substitution builds in a package, since each `expect` line is a Core expression of its own that substitutes it: a list of 1,000 texts of 900 characters in 12 `expect` lines is U2041 at the eleventh (ADR 0126 rule 5, #1632, #2264)
